<title>USA: Merrimac names Mason Carter president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Merrimac names Mason Carter president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CALDWELL, N.J. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrimac Industries Inc on Thursday said Mason Carter, currently a director of the company, has been named president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Eugene W. Niemiec, formerly the president and chief executive officer, has been named vice chairman.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
